<h2>Contributing</h2>
<p>This documentation is maintained by the K12 technical team. For updates:</p>
<ol>
<li>Submit documentation changes via pull request</li>
<li>Follow markdown formatting standards</li>
<li>Include relevant diagrams (Mermaid, PlantUML)</li>
<li>Link to source code where applicable</li>
</ol>
